# Machine state snapshots from examples/meter_snapshot.py.
#
# Ignored HERE, in the public mirror, on purpose. A snapshot carries a
# machine's asset number, serial number and complete accounting history, which
# is operator business data. It belongs in the private repository, which does
# NOT ignore this folder. The warning in meter_snapshot.py's docstring says the
# same thing; this is the part that survives a copy-paste mirror of the
# examples/ directory.
captures/
